{
  "Package": "beachmat.tiledb",
  "Version": "1.2.0",
  "Date": "2025-07-13",
  "Title": "beachmat bindings for TileDB-backed matrices",
  "Description": "Extends beachmat to initialize tatami matrices from\nTileDB-backed arrays. This allows C++ code in downstream\npackages to directly call the TileDB C/C++ library to access\narray data, without the need for block processing via\nDelayedArray. Developers only need to import this package to\nautomatically extend the capabilities of\nbeachmat::initializeCpp to TileDBArray instances.",
